# Godot export artifacts
# Godot rewrites ProjectRondo.csproj when it bumps the C# SDK reference and leaves the previous
# copy beside it. It is a backup of a tracked file, and a re-export committed one by accident.
*.csproj.old
export.cfg
export_presets.cfg
*.translation

node_modules/
dist/
src-tauri/target/
src-tauri/gen/

# Superpowers scratch (SDD ledgers, briefs, review packages, brainstorm mockups)
# — working files, not artefacts
.superpowers/
